card c12
kind: teach
type: explain
tier: deeper
scored: 0
title: Go deeper: older units
figure: older-units
figure_at: 1

body:
    Older names are still used. The curie measures activity like the becquerel, the rad measures absorbed dose like the gray, and the rem measures biological effect like the sievert. 100 rem is one sievert.
